WEBVTT

00:07:59.391 --> 00:08:01.977
I didn't make that up,
but it's so corny and I love it.

00:08:02.019 --> 00:08:03.145
(Laughter)

00:08:04.063 --> 00:08:06.398
But my addition to it

00:08:06.398 --> 00:08:09.318
is the question: "Why would we give
the present back?"

00:08:10.486 --> 00:08:12.571
Oh, your intuition is a gift.

00:08:13.822 --> 00:08:15.282
So we have to use it.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.118
So then let's talk about you.

00:08:18.118 --> 00:08:19.703
You have your intuition.

00:08:20.996 --> 00:08:23.249
And we'll use some science in here too.

00:08:23.249 --> 00:08:24.833
We're not totally against data.

00:08:24.875 --> 00:08:25.876
(Laughs)

00:08:26.502 --> 00:08:31.257
That if you are a set up of molecules, OK?